      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SUPERB FOUR BEDROOM SEMI-DETACHED HOME, LOCATED RIGHT IN THE HEART OF THE THRIVING VILLAGE OF DRUMLISH.\r\n\r\nDavis Auctioneers take pleasure in bringing to the market, this tastefully presented four-bedroom family home in the heart of the village of Drumlish. Church View Drive, along the R198, is a long-standing development just a few minutes’ drive from Longford Town, which is on the Sligo-Dublin train line. This is a greatly sought after neighbourhood, almost entirely occupied and used as family homes.  \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, sitting-room, kitchen/dining-room, with a large wheelchair accessible wc/shower room on the ground floor. There are four bedrooms in total, and a family bathroom completing the first floor living space, while the integrated garage is one of the outstanding features of this fine property.\r\n\r\nAll essential amenities are located within easy reach of the property. The village boasts supermarkets, service station, library, community sports centre, post office, bars and restaurants/take-aways. Center Parcs Holiday Resort is just a 35-minute drive away.\r\n\r\nViewing of this brilliantly presented home is highly recommended by the Auctioneers.\r\n\r\nPlease contact us on 043 3350555 to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: N39 D6Y6"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen/dining room: 5.95m x 3.30m\r\n\r\nEntrance hall: 1.50m x 2.90m \r\n\r\nSitting room: 3.50m x 4.10m\r\n\r\nWC/Shower room: 3.00m x 2.30m\r\n\r\nBed 1: 2.90m x 3.00m\r\n\r\nBed 2: 2.50m x 3.50m\r\n\r\nBed 3: 2.65m x 3.00m\r\n\r\nBed 4: 2.00m x 3.00m\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.00m x 1.80m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Integrated Garage\r\n\r\nDouble Glazed Pvc Windows and Doors\r\n\r\nSecure Wheelie Bin Storage\r\n\r\nAlong the Drumlish to Monaduff section of the North Longford Rebel Trail Walk\r\n\r\n50m to the local Garda Station\r\n\r\nJust 250m to the Village centre\r\n\r\n400m to Drumlish National School\r\n\r\nOil fired central heating\r\n\r\nPre-school & Creche just a couple of minutes walk\r\n\r\nNumerous Secondary school education facilities within 15 minutes\r\n\r\nIdeal owner occupier residence or as an investment\r\n\r\n15 Minute drive to Longford Train Station-\r\n\r\n7 Trains per day on the Dublin-Sligo Line\r\n\r\nLocal Buses and Taxi available\r\n\r\nOn The Cavan- Longford 3 times a day bus route\r\n\r\nBallinalee, Killoe, Longford and Mohill just a few minutes drive\r\n\r\nFibre Optic Broadband available\r\n\r\nLocated just a few minutes’ drive from the N4\r\n\r\nBus service to Secondary Schools in Longford and Moyne CS\r\n\r\nCavan- Longford Bus Service 3 Times Daily\r\n\r\nCommute to Dublin- 1 hour & 20 mins\r\n\r\nKids playground just a few minutes walk\r\n\r\n100m to the Local churce\r\n\r\nMains water and sewerage"
      },
